IMAPAccount mailbox
Host imap.mailbox.org
User f.m.liestmann@fx-ttr.de
PassCmd "age -d -i $HOME/.config/sops/age/keys.txt $HOME/.mailbox.age"
TLSType IMAPS

IMAPStore mailbox-remote
Account mailbox

MaildirStore mailbox-local
Path ~/Mail/
Inbox ~/Mail/INBOX/
SubFolders Verbatim

Channel mailbox
Far :mailbox-remote:
Near :mailbox-local:
Patterns * !Archives
Create Near
Expunge Both
SyncState *